== Description ==

Partnero – Affiliate & Referral Program Management for WooCommerce

Partnero is a powerful tool designed to effortlessly manage affiliate and refer-a-friend programs directly within your WooCommerce store. Whether you want to grow your customer base through referrals or boost sales with affiliate traffic, Partnero provides all the essential tools to set up, track, and manage your programs effectively.

Key Features:

- Integrated Affiliate & Referral Programs: Easily set up both affiliate and refer-a-friend programs tailored to your WooCommerce store.

- Advanced Commissions & Rewards: Set sophisticated, dynamic commission structures and engaging unique rewards.

- White label experience: design and fine-tune every aspect of your programs to offer a fully branded experience.

- Comprehensive Tracking & Analytics: Monitor conversions, track referral activity, and analyze performance with real-time data and reporting.

- Automated Payouts & Reward Distribution: Save time with scheduled payouts and automated reward distribution.

- Seamless WooCommerce Integration: Built specifically for WooCommerce, Partnero works effortlessly within your store for a smooth experience.

With Partnero, you can easily increase engagement, reach new customers, and reward loyal ones—all through a fully customizable affiliate and referral program.

Explore our complete feature set [here](https://www.partnero.com/features).

Please visit our [knowledge base](https://help.partnero.com/) or [developer documentation](https://developers.partnero.com/) to find detailed how-to guides.

== Installation ==

1. Upload plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/partnero` directory.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress.
3. Go to 'Partnero' menu and enter Partnero API Key that can be generated from Integration section over at Partnero.

== Screenshots ==
1. Set up and manage affiliate and referral campaigns seamlessly within your WooCommerce store.
2. Control when and how partners earn rewards, fine-tune every detail, and align the program with your business goals.
3. Reliable tracking & flexible promotion tools – Track performance accurately with link tracking and unique promo codes for your partners.
4. Fully customizable partner dashboard – Design the dashboard to match your brand. Add essential details, adjust the layout, and include custom content.
5. Automated payouts for effortless management – Save time by automating payouts, ensuring partners get paid quickly and accurately.

